098df0d9c459,paper_candidate,"First, have UAVs 1 through 8 form a spacious sphere centered at world-frame offset [2, 0, 1] meters from their current swarm centroid with automatic duration, smooth motion, and safety factor 1.0, continuing as soon as the trajectory completes. Then, in parallel and synchronously, have UAVs 1 through 4 form a circle centered at [-4, 18, 4] with radius 2 meters in 7 seconds using normal motion and safety factor 1.25, while UAVs 5 through 8 form a normal-scale square centered at [4, 18, 4] with automatic duration using aggressive motion and safety factor 1.0; after completion, hover and wait for 2 seconds.",1924,3384,48813,False,True,True,1.0,0,,,paper-candidate-en-v2,0327c1364145df3b5c990eef3328ee176b12bf496f4a81f7232ce99fb8e4dd91,paper-candidate-schema-v2,be6063a533f05b8d0b6e87353a40fb294975261fa1514cd5d34ced19ce2bffe7,MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed,0.0,0.01,paper_candidate
